websiteRegistrationRequired:["这个玩家名称尚未开通网站账号。请点击注册，在“已有玩家开通账号”中选择自己的名字；管理员核实后可用原名开通账号，历史战绩保留。", "This player has no website account yet. Click Register, choose your name under Existing Player. After administrator approval, open your account with the same name; your history is kept."],
websiteRegistrationHelp:["名单中已有名字，不代表已经开通网站账号。首次使用请点击注册，在“已有玩家开通账号”中选择自己；名单中没有你的名字时再选择“新玩家注册”。", "Having a name in the player list does not mean you have a website account. Click Register and select yourself under Existing Player. Choose New Player only if your name is not already listed."],
tableCreated:["桌子已创建，可立即预约或上桌。", "Table created. You can now reserve or join it."],
