registeredPlayerHelp:["只能选择已注册且未停用的账号；已在桌上的玩家不会列出。确认后仅加入成员名单，不会代替对方登录或确认成绩。", "Choose registered, active accounts. Seated players are excluded. Adding players does not log in or confirm scores as them."],
