apiNote:["只有管理员可以保存密钥；留空可保留现有密钥。连接测试不会提交对局，可达不代表写入权限已验证。API 地址需为公网 HTTPS，不能包含密钥或查询参数。","Only administrators can save keys. Leave the field blank to retain the existing key. Connection tests do not submit matches; reachability does not verify write access. Use a public HTTPS API URL without credentials or query parameters."],
nartsNote:["NARTS 仅支持合计 100000 点的四人终局，自行按 +50/+10/−10/−30 计算 PT；比赛本地默认 +30/+10/−10/−30。决赛小局变化无法导入。历史修正需人工处理，不能当作新对局重新提交。","NARTS accepts only completed four-player games totaling 100,000 points and calculates its own PT using +50/+10/−10/−30. Local tournament defaults are +30/+10/−10/−30. Finals hand deltas cannot be imported. Historical corrections require manual reconciliation and must not be resubmitted as new matches."],
